WEBVTT

00:02:59.473 --> 00:03:01.854
it's not a broken wrist,

00:03:01.854 --> 00:03:03.900
it's not nerve damage in the wrist,

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.712
it's not an infection,

00:03:05.712 --> 00:03:09.480
it's not Lyme disease."

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:13.140
And there was this deliberate 
elimination going up,

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:14.723
and I was thinking to myself,

00:03:14.723 --> 00:03:18.040
where is he going with this?

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.210
Then he put his hands on his knees,

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:23.361
he looked right at my 
27-year-old kid, and said,

00:03:23.361 --> 00:03:26.577
"I don't know how to 
tell a 27-year-old this:

00:03:26.577 --> 00:03:30.472
Pete, you have ALS."